      "writtenOn": "2022-02-15T17:43:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Dropped this change and added it to SkTreatAsSprite. I considered not checking SkTreatAsSprite thinking that we\u0027d generally not have any visual effect for an image drawn at 1-to-1, but then I realized if the image were f16 or higher precision than the destination, we\u0027d still benefit from dithering at 1-to-1.",
