      "writtenOn": "2022-02-14T21:35:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t need to check SkPaintPriv::UseDither here because this is sufficient. When the paint disables dithering, we don\u0027t care about the dst color type or if the paint has a non-constant effect, dithering is always disabled. When the paint does request dithering, we defer to the dst color type or their being a non-const shader, but since this is the drawImage canvas call, we know we\u0027re always overriding the paints shader so UseDither() will match isDither().",
